      "text": "The shipboard CTD's analog channels carry an offset: the NotInUse channel (voltage 7) reads a median 1.589 V instead of 0 V. It was subtracted scan by scan from the SBE43 (SN 2778) voltage before the Winkler gain, lowering the CTD oxygen by a median 3.86 ml/l."
