    {
      "severity": "caveat",
      "code": "ctd_o2_converted",
      "text": "The .cnv has no sbox0Mm/Kg column, so shipboard SBE43 oxygen was converted from ml/l to umol/kg with the Sea-Bird formula (ml/l x 44660 / (EOS-80 sigma-theta + 1000)), using sal00, t090C and prDM."
    },
    {
      "severity": "caveat",
      "code": "ctd_processing",
      "text": "Reference .cnv was processed with datcnv only; alignctd / celltm / loopedit are not applied, which matters for the SBE43 oxygen sensor."
